<title>FRANCE: Two million Suez shares traded off market Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Two million Suez shares traded off market Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of two million shares in Cie de Suez was traded off the market on Tuesday after closing at a price of 187.40 francs per share, dealers said.</p>
<p>Suez said it had no comment on the reported transaction.</p>
</text>
